--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Teacher_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b24d2dda7180a914e9db41f0abbdaffb, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 210993967106
    m_Localized: ...Can you... hear me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161408
    m_Localized: ...Can you hear my voice...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161409
    m_Localized: '...Oh... at last...

      Someone capable of hearing my voice
      has appeared...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161410
    m_Localized: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161411
    m_Localized: ...You ask who I am?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161412
    m_Localized: "...I am the one who once looked down upon \nthe Jianghu from its
      highest peak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161413
    m_Localized: 'Countless peerless masters challenged me, yet none were able to
      surpass me.

      The world called me the pinnacle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161414
    m_Localized: 'But now... I am nothing more than a remnant of a soul

      left
      within this single stone fragment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161415
    m_Localized: What do you desire from me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161416
    m_Localized: '...It is humiliating beyond words, but...

      I was sealed
      long ago.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161417
    m_Localized: 'Those damned bastards who sealed me...

      Perhaps not satisfied
      with sealing me alone,

      they shattered even my Sealing Stone into pieces
      and scattered them across the Jianghu.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161418
    m_Localized: 'Thus passed tens of years... hundreds of years...

      Perhaps
      even longer than that...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161419
    m_Localized: 'And at last...

      I met you. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161420
    m_Localized: "Uncountable were those who held my Sealing Stone. \nBut... only
      you could hear my voice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161421
    m_Localized: 'Therefore, I shall make you an offer.

      Become my disciple,
      and find my Sealing Stones.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161422
    m_Localized: 'If you do so...

      I shall impart to you everything I possess.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161423
    m_Localized: Yes, I will become your disciple!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161424
    m_Localized: No, I will not become your disciple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161425
    m_Localized: What is the reason for finding the Sealing Stones?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161426
    m_Localized: 'Good.

      From this moment on, you are my disciple.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161427
    m_Localized: 'There is no need for the Nine Prostrations Ceremony.

      Let
      us dispense with such empty formalities.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161428
    m_Localized: 'I shall teach you my martial art, <b>Peach Blossom Art</b>.

      Listen
      carefully and remember it well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161429
    m_Localized: 'I sense my soul nearby...

      ...It is at the mountain summit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161430
    m_Localized: 'My disciple, head to the summit of the mountain.

      Another
      Sealing Stone lies there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161431
    m_Localized: Ha ha... Quite bold, aren't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161432
    m_Localized: Then perhaps there is no longer any reason for you to remain alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161433
    m_Localized: 'It is merely my speculation...

      but after so many years,
      it seems the seal has weakened.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161434
    m_Localized: 'Therefore, if the scattered Sealing Stones are gathered together
      once more,

      I may finally be able to break free from this restraint.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210998161435
    m_Localized: 'Thus, I would like you to become my disciple

      and recover
      the Sealing Stones for me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210838777856
    m_Localized: What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210972995584
    m_Localized: How is your training going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189888
    m_Localized: Have you come to seek my teachings?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189889
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189890
    m_Localized: I would like to ask where the sealing stone is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189891
    m_Localized: I seek your guidance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189892
    m_Localized: I am curious as to why you only taught me a part of the Peach Blossom
      Art.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 380527873388544
    m_Localized: "..Hmm.. I don't feel anything right now. \nFocus on your training
      for the time being."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189893
    m_Localized: "..Tsk. Have you already forgotten? \n..It is the summit of the
      mountain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189894
    m_Localized: "Head to the mountain peak. \nMy sealing stone is there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189895
    m_Localized: Martial arts do not consist of forms alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189896
    m_Localized: "A trained body, accumulated internal energy, numerous real battles,
      and enlightenment. \nIf any one of these is lacking, you cannot reach the top."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189897
    m_Localized: Do not slack in your training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189898
    m_Localized: Even swinging the same stance ten thousand times is not in vain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189899
    m_Localized: 'For at any moment, a new enlightenment may bloom from that single
      tip of the blade.

      So slash the enemy, and slash them again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189900
    m_Localized: "A strong body alone cannot make one a master, \nnor can deep internal
      energy alone speak of the world."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189901
    m_Localized: Only when mind, energy, and body are united as one does one become
      a true martial artist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15286526308352
    m_Localized: Do not turn away from those in distress within the Jianghu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15286526308353
    m_Localized: "There is enlightenment gained through the blade, \nbut there is
      also enlightenment gained by saving lives."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189902
    m_Localized: You remember that my soul was sealed away, do you not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189903
    m_Localized: 'Could it be the aftereffects of the seal...?

      Even my memories
      have been lost in fragments.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210977189904
    m_Localized: Because of this, there are many things I wish to pass on but cannot
      yet reveal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210993967104
    m_Localized: 'However, the more scattered Sealing Stones you recover,

      the
      more of my lost memories will return.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 210993967105
    m_Localized: 'When that time comes...

      I shall pass down the rest of the
      Peach Blossom Art to you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
